msgctxt "quest/047/ChrHdy351_04772:TEXT_CHRHDY351_04772_SYSTEM_000_000:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “In Need of Adjustment,” you will receive a Manderville weapon for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "Обратите внимание: после завершения задания « Нужна доработка» вы получите оружие Мандервиллей для профессии <if ($gn68 == 10)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."

#. ja: 『堂々たるマンダヴィルウェポン』を、<br>「<if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>」で受けますか？
#. de: Möchtest du den Auftrag mit deinem aktuellen Job <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> annehmen?
#. fr: Commencer la quête en restant <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/047/ChrHdy351_04772:TEXT_CHRHDY351_04772_SYSTEM_000_001:1"
msgid "Please ensure you have changed to your desired job before speaking with the House Manderville artisan."
msgstr "Перед разговором с ремесленником дома Мандервиллей выберите нужную профессию."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のマンダヴィルウェポンを作成しますか？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Transmuter l'arme des Manderville pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/047/ChrHdy351_04772:TEXT_CHRHDY351_04772_Q1_000_001:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: もう少し考える
#. de: Ich möchte den Job wechseln.
#. fr: Prendre le temps de réfléchir
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/047/ChrHdy351_04772:TEXT_CHRHDY351_04772_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as another job."
msgstr "Выполнить задание за другую профессию."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のマンダヴィルウェポンを作成する
#. de: Ich möchte den Auftrag als <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> weiterspielen.
#. fr: Transmuter l'arme des Manderville pour <if $gn4><sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if>
#. speaker: A1
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
